{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "73822304-eaa1-4524-ad22-d9528825ca76",
    "name": "StudyMind Redação — Painel admin",
    "description": "Painel admin: visão geral, lista e detalhe de alunos, Pro manual (conceder e revogar), zerar cota e reenviar verificação.\n\nRode pelo Runner, na ordem. O setup cria um aluno novo a cada execução e faz login com a SUA conta ADMIN.\n\nPreencha antes as variáveis `adminEmail` e `adminSenha` (conta com role ADMIN no banco). Não gasta chamadas do Gemini.\n\nO 403 para aluno logado fica coberto pelos testes automatizados (AdminControllerTest e SecurityAdminTest).\n\nAjuste `baseUrl` se não estiver em http://localhost:8080.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup (aluno novo + login do admin)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cadastro aluno",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/cadastro",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "cadastro"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Aluno Painel\",\n  \"email\": \"{{emailAluno}}\",\n  \"senha\": \"{{senha}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailAluno\", `aluno.painel.${Date.now()}@teste.com`);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"alunoId\", pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login admin",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"senha\": \"{{adminSenha}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tokenAdmin\", pm.response.json().accessToken);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Visão geral",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Visão geral 30 dias (200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/visao-geral?periodo=30",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "visao-geral"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "periodo",
                  "value": "30"
                }
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
